	(text "During programmed operation, /M1 is high, and all 32 internal\nregisters are accessible.  A13 controls the ST1 input.\n\nDuring INTA, /M1 is low, all address bits are low, and ST1 is low.\n\nFor EOI, read register 0 with A13=1."
